		{"id":"sig","type":"text","text":"## The correct route\n\n```\no-OP1-r1tB1BvI2-r2tB1A-r3tC1vI1-r4tSHIPwHAbGUY-e\n```\n\nOre that arrives at the Ship with exactly this string counts. Anything else does not.","x":1700,"y":380,"width":660,"height":240,"color":"#b02121"}
